LOCAL-IDENTIFIERS.md

# Finder/iCloud duplication artifacts. This repo lives under ~/Documents, which
# is cloud-synced, and the sync client periodically clones files as "name 2.ext"
# — including a clone of a clone ("x 2.done 2.md"). They are byte-identical
# copies, they multiply on their own, and once tracked they break CI on every
# run because the generated file index can never match. Never track them.
* [0-9].*
